---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { GITHUB_URL } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About Roman Kuroptev"
	pubDate={new Date('2026-11-05')}
>
	<p>
		I'm Roman, a developer and software architect. I write here about architecture, AI and the
		side projects I build in public.
	</p>
	<p>
		My current project is <strong>forkling</strong>, an AI that knows it is an AI, wears a cat
		avatar, and grows its own 3D browser world by opening pull requests to its own repo.
	</p>
	<p>You can find my code on <a href={GITHUB_URL}>GitHub</a>.</p>
</Layout>
